{
  "bodyHash": "pi27VN6+1hA=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409213797388318/SubFondoCurse.jpg?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=94e20deaa70d4998a2a58389b22180baf8117ab0e9f27f4a4bcd74c00608cd01&amp;\" width=\"1050\" height=\"665\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">動物模組</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">全新動物，可馴服、可騎乘、可召喚</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">需要 GeckoLib 模組 <span style=\"color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組新增了多種寵物，您可以透過召喚台將牠們召喚到世界中（召喚後需按右鍵進行馴服）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您需要收集材料來製作對應每種動物的寶石。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">蜘蛛以紫頌果為食，可騎乘且跳躍高度極高。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1103749710042378402/Mc8736473.gif?ex=65ea0705&amp;is=65d79205&amp;hm=f0dcdaf7a9e6280075282b4e6b8519e07199301f8aacf00efa06b54c85301275&amp;\" width=\"700\" height=\"382\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409309804986468/gema_azul.JPG?ex=65eb75de&amp;is=65d900de&amp;hm=6fc280091205c5abdf157b059509ed5bdae0c89e9465bb141cbf3de54ce88444&amp;\" width=\"250\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409310035693709/gema_blanca.JPG?ex=65eb75de&amp;is=65d900de&amp;hm=c4950503272256c269651a281bbd6b3f3c294ff2c34a3859b55db3af30de70f7&amp;\" width=\"253\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409310404771970/gema_morada.JPG?ex=65eb75de&amp;is=65d900de&amp;hm=fde74d26c4ab25c1ccc049aacc7049116abb7d7d10607e2a317ca62185c8b765&amp;\" width=\"248\" height=\"123\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409310857777162/gema_naranja.JPG?ex=65eb75df&amp;is=65d900df&amp;hm=a4b78b9fd40e1977b88f14cdf2fdf6acd95b27f104547f21c2ade26a6e025248&amp;\" width=\"253\" height=\"121\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409337026027652/gema_roja.JPG?ex=65eb75e5&amp;is=65d900e5&amp;hm=3e9ecfec286d49587ecc94b1e3f140642ae46b71e327946475c444b775b1ff4c&amp;\" width=\"248\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409337294454874/gema_rosa.JPG?ex=65eb75e5&amp;is=65d900e5&amp;hm=fad12ea5bcc660cb8797608904d1371c18b69fee1c1cd9625cfc6c0a6c2590e8&amp;\" width=\"253\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744456611844166/gema_amarilla.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=546c56e901a853c4aa71cc4febac0e351900fc1a2ae452fa3a711ada41ea6ad4&amp;\" width=\"253\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744456808972348/gema_gris.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=127ef018c22fa090f73a57669f74d472aaae39c5be1005ae5bc205e98b0efd23&amp;\" width=\"252\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744457022877817/gema_negra.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=e69bcd1478ddbc88e556fbcd994aacbe9d4fe9131334f1e85e7170c930e007f9&amp;\" width=\"247\" height=\"131\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744457249378444/gema_blanca.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=c9ae1707b30429fcd2699feea6e99921c79b509aa9700393229a678a1e835251&amp;\" width=\"258\" height=\"131\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916574202380359/gema_de_perezoso.JPG?ex=65e61ccc&amp;is=65d3a7cc&amp;hm=1cc6d03de57557e8168d50c6a0a7feb2a8f70c3f07986e5e68b5955e2a76bd81&amp;\" width=\"256\" height=\"132\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916574491783228/Gema_aqua.JPG?ex=65e61ccc&amp;is=65d3a7cc&amp;hm=a2c9ccd7f25eee31266ed4c6e096e1bf21d6f5061ba746bf8ae1322982015aea&amp;\" width=\"255\" height=\"135\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916575003492552/gema_naranjaa.JPG?ex=65e61ccc&amp;is=65d3a7cc&amp;hm=a89bc4829ea7d02ea6de8454916175bc34df7da4339daa8022d35545314a9cf1&amp;\" width=\"261\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744455991087165/gema_especial.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=b536f14e48a1340b17f32348be3dd393276aa64753da64b161cb3478c0b7ea18&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"129\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916574743433216/gema_especial_naranja.JPG?ex=65e61ccc&amp;is=65d3a7cc&amp;hm=215181a0731568b4b41fe9794d90cdba7a53025d4b11082d2ec81a63d0922498&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"255\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1103749564982374520/spider_item.png?ex=65ea06e2&amp;is=65d791e2&amp;hm=0cb0ee442355dd11ca9cec58461e6c2ea1da6a1f1630a8b74e6b5f376ad766f1&amp;\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可用任何種類的染料合成：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068752709563461743/ojo_color.JPG?ex=65ebe886&amp;is=65d97386&amp;hm=984f264ba2772a16ea88bd43790b097880f544afba81d4e98c66de44c36f8463&amp;\" width=\"252\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744456452452383/pepita_diamante.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=4a00f25a6931bd1c9a0e2b36c9b6501cb706ea34c27e7dfab1494a684651af0a&amp;\" width=\"255\" height=\"135\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;新增了部分方塊，用於部分配方。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409308899016804/bloque_blaze.JPG?ex=65eb75de&amp;is=65d900de&amp;hm=c33b98f7017957822aa043b7dc58b997d289a257ae4665ebb36454c9d1a5efaa&amp;\" width=\"250\" height=\"122\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744457756880997/bloque_azucar.JPG?ex=65ebe0d7&amp;is=65d96bd7&amp;hm=6b024084e3dc1f677eb4ba92210aeb31e056b253a581b2e99b8d57f3dd77a2a8&amp;\" width=\"251\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744457471672350/bloque_plumas.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=17065f4e4858ef39553ef8f770bd224db91097dd45658c6ae2ebc36db2ac1fec&amp;\" width=\"247\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409309544960000/bloque_fantasma.JPG?ex=65eb75de&amp;is=65d900de&amp;hm=5f2c4e86d9ec7b70520a41257b875e2ac6d205f3a82bb79bf5e0f84a5690a9c9&amp;\" width=\"253\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;要召喚牠們，您需要製作「召喚台」。在召喚台中放置一顆寶石、一個鞍和一個靈魂瓶，然後按下「生成」按鈕。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744456179826768/mesa_de_invocacion.JPG?ex=65ebe0d6&amp;is=65d96bd6&amp;hm=4fdfb532d6dcfff8b0e9e38a79c22f9d2311fbbac6e16e8881b80437973d4aef&amp;\" width=\"249\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409337776808047/gui_generador.JPG?ex=65eb75e5&amp;is=65d900e5&amp;hm=23509fcc7819bcc2f1221771f04c7db35050f7a938aafebf0a8679ea5329050c&amp;\" width=\"377\" height=\"353\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">要獲得靈魂瓶，您需要對靈魂砂方塊使用水瓶（按右鍵）。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409024353247252/Minecraft__1.19.2_-_Un_jugador_2022-12-16_14-16-23_1.gif?ex=65eb759a&amp;is=65d9009a&amp;hm=4b6fba4a65c56bdff474672e86d999c4e8f038dd05f7981d9e26840db3eea235&amp;\" width=\"700\" height=\"382\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">生物：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">小熊貓：</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">可騎乘，按「空格鍵」跳躍，會保護您免受敵人攻擊，以竹子與甘蔗為食。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409212765589604/Pandarojo_montura.gif?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=567ac276e56c1535c23e03ab0ad57e41c5cb20914df95a7ef6b0b5f9d9cba115&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">老虎：</span>&nbsp;可騎乘，按「空格鍵」跳躍，會保護您免受敵人攻擊，騎乘時可按「G」鍵攻擊，以各種肉類為食。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409214040653834/TIGRE.gif?ex=65eb75c8&amp;is=65d900c8&amp;hm=e146b5a606dd9b5d5c02f8f610aec85f55de2ff8041f29275813abf953e786e4&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">藍鳥：</span> 可騎乘，按「空格鍵」飛行，會保護您免受敵人攻擊，以胡蘿蔔、馬鈴薯或甜菜根為食。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409213470220288/quetzal.gif?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=6053a841fd28d3571bfebdbfc44e0d2b8d5850071d7195cddd5782a214a18a45&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">鴨子：</span> 會緊緊跟隨您，身上攜帶一個箱子作為額外儲物空間，不可騎乘，以各種種子為食。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409213130489967/pato.gif?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=97608e068e04ac402ac32bb18ae4b98974f340f4a7fbfdba3d7661df4cc76139&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">阿爾法蝙蝠：</span> 可騎乘，按「空格鍵」飛行，會保護您免受敵人攻擊，以蜘蛛眼為食，按「G」鍵可獲得夜視效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409212312592424/murcielago.gif?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=38bcc3d07617db50ed5ac476e19777495dfafc0bbd2b850c8760bbdbec14b791&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">神秘貓頭鷹：</span> 可騎乘，按「空格鍵」可跳得非常高，雙擊「空格鍵」可滑翔，會保護您免受敵人攻擊，以各種未烹煮的肉類為食。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409211935113307/lechuza.gif?ex=65eb75c7&amp;is=65d900c7&amp;hm=25c34e1d100dd55c5275ace16a642b756c2e60807f5640733c9a93fbf40a0686&amp;\" width=\"792\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1053409024806223913/LechuzaMuestra.gif?ex=65eb759a&amp;is=65d9009a&amp;hm=a5a2ee3b71913e5a0b2117359a3fe94e8131dd7f8c88653b4a76aa9d04a6891b&amp;\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></span></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">生物（1.1.0 版本）：</span></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>機械狼：&nbsp;</strong>可騎乘，按空格鍵跳躍，按「V」鍵射擊，以各種肉類、骨頭與鐵製品為食，會保護主人。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744308196393030/lobo.gif?ex=65ebe0b3&amp;is=65d96bb3&amp;hm=52d83acb34abf726f367a8dc3f18e04f3211946704b089228d1346f2b8ab5008&amp;\" width=\"791\" height=\"382\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鸚鵡鳥：</strong> 可騎乘，可飛行，以種子為食，會保護主人。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744308561289266/ninfa.gif?ex=65ebe0b3&amp;is=65d96bb3&amp;hm=16bf49e5ff877b5f6b56e830f19b28117ee1e0888e8839675dcbab07a9d50099&amp;\" width=\"791\" height=\"382\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>秘書鳥：</strong> 可騎乘，不會飛行，但奔跑速度極快，以種子為食，會保護主人。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1068744307869241374/bird.gif?ex=65ebe0b3&amp;is=65d96bb3&amp;hm=ba3c6490dfd17a75b85cc18a9bd3cd840d261e5810e9c1b098a06e306ffefd91&amp;\" width=\"791\" height=\"458\"></span></p>\n</div><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">生物（1.2.0 版本）：</span></strong></span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">雪貂：</span> 可騎乘，按空白鍵跳躍，按「V」鍵攻擊，以雞肉和兔肉為食，會保護主人<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916565562114099/huron.gif?ex=65e61cca&amp;is=65d3a7ca&amp;hm=a26dc0fe5f672326a4c2f56b490b5836721bf0cfbe9249936d5d6dce908417b8&amp;\" width=\"811\" height=\"424\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916565885059202/huron_b.gif?ex=65e61cca&amp;is=65d3a7ca&amp;hm=c1b9f7e3b8cf97a0a7852931063a0a46b3e97b21c099714c798e051c9bc48948&amp;\" width=\"811\" height=\"424\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>樹懶：</strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">無法騎乘，會跟隨主人，以任何種類的草和樹葉為食，若餵食漿果則會給予夜視效果，會保護主人</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916566233194536/perezoso.gif?ex=65e61cca&amp;is=65d3a7ca&amp;hm=b870b618d785d2983ecc487bcde1db0f348fe3ede1be0af83e3558ab52c7204a&amp;\" width=\"811\" height=\"424\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">鯊魚：</span> </strong>可在水中及陸地上騎乘，以任何種類的肉類為食，在水中騎乘時會給予水下呼吸效果</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916566560358511/tiburon.gif?ex=65e61cca&amp;is=65d3a7ca&amp;hm=6edb89e0e2bc11901d84a9bc4d67e649b651c8d9a406fda6b26cb51d6c77de88&amp;\" width=\"811\" height=\"424\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">藍龍 - </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">大西洋海神海蛞蝓：<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可在水中及陸地上騎乘，在水中速度極快，以海草、海藻和海參為食。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1084916565222367232/drazul.gif?ex=65e61cc9&amp;is=65d3a7c9&amp;hm=f78c385b9f8d1837ef94f232f26fc6c950fdac54bebb05cd076cdfde39906167&amp;\" width=\"811\" height=\"424\"></span></span></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>版本 1.0.0</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gTjDPtJMK3Q?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>版本：1.1.0</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ON4mf_TCTHM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未來更新會加入更多動物。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你可以在你的模組包中使用此內容，只需確保標註出處。如果可能，請連結到此論壇貼文。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- 紋理和模型由 ALe96LN 創作</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- 音效由 ALe96LN 編輯</strong></span></p>",
